flowchart TD
  P[Application producer] --> PORT[Application JobRuntimePort]
  PORT --> AUTH{Tenant and canonical reference authorized?}
  AUTH -- no --> REJECT[Sanitized stable rejection]
  AUTH -- yes --> CATALOG{Allowlisted task and version?}
  CATALOG -- no --> REJECT
  CATALOG -- yes --> SCHEMA{Strict schema, JSON shape, secret and 64 KiB checks?}
  SCHEMA -- no --> REJECT
  SCHEMA -- yes --> KEY[Semantic job key and fixed queue/retry policy]
  KEY --> REG[(Application delivery registry: pending)]
  REG --> ENQUEUE[Graphile public addJob]
  ENQUEUE -- DB outage or pool exhaustion --> COMP[Compensate and mark delivery failed]
  ENQUEUE --> QUEUED[Registry queued with opaque job id]
  QUEUED --> LOCK[Graphile lock and named-queue serialization]
  LOCK --> EXEC[Validate again and invoke application handler]
  EXEC -- retryable failure --> RETRY[Registry redelivery pending]
  RETRY --> LOCK
  EXEC -- terminal failure --> FAILED[Registry delivery failed]
  EXEC -- return --> ACK[Registry delivery acknowledged]
  ACK --> CANON[Canonical domain workflow records business completion separately]
  SIG[SIGTERM or SIGINT] --> DRAIN[Readiness false; stop new claims]
  DRAIN --> DONE{Active work stops before deadline?}
  DONE -- yes --> STOP[Close runtime]
  DONE -- no --> FORCE[Force stop and mark running deliveries for redelivery]
  FORCE --> STOP
